(
    title: "International Soccer",
    description: Some("Team football on a pitch that scrolls to keep the ball in view, with no offsides, goalies or set pieces to interrupt it. You steer one man at a time, dribbling slows him down, and a pass flies in whichever direction you last pushed the stick. Anyone running off the top or bottom reappears at the opposite edge — so the quickest way back to defend your goal is to run away from it."),
